## Antigravity note

When this thread is running **Orchestrator (Neon)**, Antigravity already pairs Gemini 4 Neon (planner/reviewer) with Gemini 4 Hydrogen (executor) automatically inside a single turn, so you can skip delegating single-slice edits to `implementer` unless you want parallel or workspace-isolated execution.
